  "limitations": [
    "Advanced remains optional, unscored and default-ineligible. Physical radio/touch, pilot feedback, aircraft measurements, iOS execution and wider hardware remain deferred. Validated propwash/ground effect and scored/default promotion remain gated.",
    "Current public acceptance covers fresh password entry, saved rates, offline process reopen and short neutral-input recording replay/disposal. It does not qualify physical controls, maximum-duration native flight, every installed-update path or startup reliability.",
    "The earlier World readiness timeout remains failed and unexplained in docs/fpv-boundary-public-acceptance.json. Three later baseline observations and this acceptance do not establish its cause.",
    "New startup request/capture metadata uses finite error categories. This does not claim unchanged outer action-error stacks or page-error logs are globally URL-free.",
    "Desktop execution is a labelled Electron fixture on one ARM64 Mac; production authentication, signed installers and iOS runtime were not exercised.",
    "Archive capacity uses retained hosted verification bound to inventory and artifact ID; the large Pages archive was not downloaded again locally. No gate bypass, manual merge or deployment was used."
